# Normalise line endings so the repo is identical on Windows, macOS and CI.
# Without this, every file committed from Windows shows up as fully rewritten
# in diffs on other platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Data and lock files must stay byte-stable — they are the evidence base and
# the reproducibility guarantee.
*.jsonl -text
uv.lock -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
